{"product_id":"gid://shopify/Product/7378776522910","title":"ENSKY Mechanical Pencil My Hero Academia Izuku Midoriya Kuru Toga 0.5Mm","old_description":"\n                        \u003ch3\u003e Details: \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e Brand: Ensky\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003cli\u003e Weight: 20g\u003c/li\u003e\n                        \u003c/ul\u003e\n            ","new_description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDescription\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe ENSKY Mechanical Pencil My Hero Academia Izuku Midoriya Kuru Toga 0.5Mm is a perfect blend of functionality and fandom. Designed for fans of the popular anime series My Hero Academia, this mechanical pencil brings a touch of your favorite character, Izuku Midoriya, to your everyday writing tasks. Its sleek design and precise 0.5mm lead size make it ideal for detailed writing and drawing, providing both style and performance in one compact tool.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eWhether you're a student, artist, or collector, this mechanical pencil enhances your writing experience with its innovative Kuru Toga mechanism that keeps the lead sharp and consistent. The pencil's lightweight build makes it comfortable to hold for extended periods, while its character-themed design adds a unique flair to your stationery collection. Enjoy a practical and fun writing tool that stands out from the usual pencils.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDetails\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Product Material:\u003c/strong\u003e Plastic\u003c/p\u003e \u003